{
  "0": [
    {
      "text": "Most investors think ETFs avoid the",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.1
    },
    {
      "text": "collectible tax. The IRS disagrees.",
      "startSec": 2.1,
      "endSec": 4.88
    }
  ],
  "1": [
    {
      "text": "The IRS classifies physical silver as a",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.16
    },
    {
      "text": "collectible under section 408-merse.",
      "startSec": 2.16,
      "endSec": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Long-term gains are taxed at a maximum",
      "startSec": 3.92,
      "endSec": 6.32
    },
    {
      "text": "28%. SLV gets the same treatment in",
      "startSec": 6.32,
      "endSec": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "taxable accounts.",
      "startSec": 9,
      "endSec": 10.08
    },
    {
      "text": "The underlying assets classification",
      "startSec": 10.08,
      "endSec": 11.57
    },
    {
      "text": "passes through to the ETF shareholder.",
      "startSec": 11.57,
      "endSec": 13.2
    },
    {
      "text": "You don't get the 20% stock rate just",
      "startSec": 13.2,
      "endSec": 14.66
    },
    {
      "text": "because you bought a fund.",
      "startSec": 14.66,
      "endSec": 15.76
    }
  ],
  "2": [
    {
      "text": "The iShares Silver Trust charges 0.50%",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 3.24
    },
    {
      "text": "per year, paid by gradually reducing",
      "startSec": 3.24,
      "endSec": 4.9
    },
    {
      "text": "the silver backing per share.",
      "startSec": 4.9,
      "endSec": 6.5600000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "After 10 years, you have paid about 5%",
      "startSec": 6.5600000000000005,
      "endSec": 8.36
    },
    {
      "text": "of your investment in fees without a",
      "startSec": 8.36,
      "endSec": 9.8
    },
    {
      "text": "single trade.",
      "startSec": 9.8,
      "endSec": 10.8
    },
    {
      "text": "The Silver per share has declined from",
      "startSec": 10.8,
      "endSec": 12.77
    },
    {
      "text": "1.0oz in inception to about 0.96oz in",
      "startSec": 12.77,
      "endSec": 15.51
    },
    {
      "text": "2026.",
      "startSec": 15.51,
      "endSec": 16.64
    }
  ],
  "3": [
    {
      "text": "PSLV is a Canadian trust and qualifies",
      "startSec": 0,
